      "Language": "fre",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In two out of three women breast reduction and reconstructive abdominoplasty relieve back pain and even sciatica. The biomechanical action of these techniques is analyzed. Further research consists of comparative measurements of intra-disc and spinal intra-muscular pressures between the pre- and post-operative periods."},
